## Metadata

- Artefact: S04 Business Capability Map
- Phase: b
- Purpose: Name the capabilities S04 establishes and the outcome each delivers.
- Scope: Capabilities delivered by the action registry slice; workflow execution is recorded as deferred.

## Entries

- **API contract / Action declaration and projection** - {"detail": "One value, three projections, proven by spec_hash equality across manifest, resolved operation and MCP tool.", "objective": "One ActionSpec projects to manifest, operation, MCP tool and route."}
- **API contract / Registry consistency** - {"detail": "Compile-time registry with six checks; DB-backed external/workflow registry; one namespace with no precedence.", "objective": "Keep one namespace that fails closed."}
- **Service operation / Idempotent invocation** - {"detail": "Mutation, action_invocation and audit_event share one transaction; the loser of an idempotency claim replays the winner.", "objective": "Make retries safe and auditable."}
- **Integration / External action ingest** - {"detail": "Hash-pinned specs, refresh diffs, automatic approval of added-optional changes and refusal of breaking changes.", "objective": "Bring external OpenAPI operations under the same invocation contract."}
- **Integration / Outbound resilience** - {"detail": "Per-action circuit breaker at five failures in 30 s; timeout, 4xx and 5xx map to RFC 9457 problems.", "objective": "Contain external failures."}
- **Interfaces / MCP parity** - {"detail": "rmcp at /mcp with tenant sessions, scope-filtered tools/list and HTTP/MCP behavioural equality.", "objective": "Expose the same actions to MCP clients."}
- **Governance / OpenAPI lock** - {"detail": "Per-operation sha256 lock; --check-lock exits 1 naming the changed operation.", "objective": "Catch contract drift before release."}
- **Deferred / Workflow actions** - {"detail": "kind: workflow returns 501 until S13.", "objective": "Keep the enum, defer the engine."}
